OL,3,GNEWSAWoman becomes first female
OL,4,Astandard bearer in charity's history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sutton Coldfield veteran who lost her
OL,7,Fsight due to a rare eye condition is
OL,8,Fset to make history as the first female
OL,9,Fstandard bearer in the history of a
OL,10,Fnational charity.
OL,12,FSimy Martin, 59, carried the standard
OL,13,Fduring Remembrance Sunday
OL,14,Fcommemorations in Manchester for Blind
OL,15,FVeterans UK.
OL,17,FIt marks her first official duty in the
OL,18,Fceremonial role and a milestone for the
OL,19,Fcharity, which supports blind and
OL,20,Fvision-impaired veterans across the
OL,21,Fcountry.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
