OL,3,GNEWSAWoman becomes first female
OL,4,Astandard bearer in charity's history
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former soldier, who served in the
OL,7,FWomen's Royal Army Corps, said she felt
OL,8,F"very proud" to represent the national
OL,9,Fcharity for vision-impaired ex-service
OL,10,Fpersonnel.
